49478", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618515_27075490692082810_46830551376919340_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UNh5bL54hwQQ7kNvwGGqeHL&_nc_oc=AdpFZgGKJnVl7HLRVMORFKbFxY65j9B8n2wEKGkCVFjlcWHFe128ctGW8-l4hm6Q33c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIbW0Hz2T3Qd6xxbmRgaCHLoUUt2vtRkBvSqCxoEgCDIg&oe=6AA15A87"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "HVAC Package Unit Installation", "keywords": [], "long_description": "HVAC Package Unit Installation is an immersive VR training application designed to simulate real-world installation procedures for HVAC package units. Learners engage in step-by-step, hands-on scenarios covering equipment positioning, connections, safety protocols, and system checks in a risk-free virtual environment.\nThis application is an integral component of the ImmerseLearn HVAC Package Unit Installation micro-credential program. It is not a standalone product access is exclusively granted to individuals enrolled in the program, ensuring a guided and structured learning experience.\nThrough interactive VR modules, users develop practical skills, improve accuracy, and build confidence before performing tasks in real-world settings. Ideal for aspiring technicians and professionals seeking experiential HVAC training.", "short_description": "Experience hands-on HVAC training in VR with the HVAC Package Unit Installation app. This simulation is part of the ImmerseLearn micro-credential program and provides guided, real-world installation practice. Access is exclusively available to learners enrolled in the program for structured, immersive skill development."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ImmerseLearn", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://immerselearn.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "